        "page": 1,
        "text": "APPOINTMENT CHANGE CONFIRMATION\nBrookfield Supply Co. | Transportation message export\nMESSAGE METADATA\nMessage ID: MSG-BSC-0811-338 | Sent: August 11, 2026, 2:05 PM Eastern\nFrom: Maya Chen <transport@brookfieldsupply.example>\nTo: Evan Brooks <dispatch@alderfreight.example>\nSubject: Approved reschedule - LD-260812-77 / AP-BSC-771\nCUSTOMER INSTRUCTION\nOur Richmond receiving dock will be unavailable for the original August 12 appointment due to scheduled dock maintenance. Please deliver on August 13, 2026 at 2:00 PM Eastern instead. This is a customer-requested change. Appointment AP-BSC-771 revision 2 replaces revision 1. No carrier late-delivery charge applies for moving delivery to this revised appointment. The agreed $4,800.00 compensation under RC-771 remains unchanged.\nAPPOINTMENT RECORD\nOriginal appointment\nAugust 12, 2026, 10:00 AM Eastern\nRevised appointment\nAugust 13, 2026, 2:00 PM Eastern\nEffective revision\nAP-BSC-771 revision 2\nLinked load / PO\nLD-260812-77 / PO-BSC-8841\nCARRIER ACKNOWLEDGMENT\nReply recorded August 11, 2026 at 2:17 PM Eastern: Confirmed. Dispatch updated to August 13 at 2:00 PM Eastern. Evan Brooks Export reference: MSG-BSC-0811-338 | Thread status: Confirmed. Case LOG-001 | Load LD-260812-77 | Page 1 of 1"
